# ─── Supabase credentials ────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Get these from: https://supabase.com → your project → Settings → API
#
# BOTH values are required. The app will crash on load if these are missing.
# Copy this file to .env and fill in the real values before running.
#
EXPO_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=https://xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx.supabase.co
EXPO_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.your-actual-anon-key-here
